{"agent":"Monster3-B-quota-pause-eval-7267fe","data":{"by":"Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"`_one` computes `r.value / w.limit` for every `B.OK` reading without ensuring `w.limit` is nonzero. Given a limited profile containing a window whose limit is `0.0` and a meter reading with `status=B.OK` and `value=0.0`, `evaluate` raises `ZeroDivisionError` instead of returning a `WindowEval`. A zero allowance is not the same as the unlimited profile state, so the module either needs to define the fraction/pause behavior for zero limits or reject such windows before division.","digest":"0bdaf2c2eaf9477b","family":"alibaba","location":"quota_eval.py:_one","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"quota_eval.py:_one"},{"chunk":2,"detail":"The test asserts that when the only known `resets_at` is already in the past, `decide` returns `resume_at == NOW` even though the window is still over the pause line. With `profile(W5H)`, a 95% reading whose reset was `2026-11-12T11:00:00+00:00`, `now=2026-11-12T12:00:00Z`, `pause_at=0.9`, and `recheck_interval=300`, the asserted result is a pause whose resume time is the current instant. A caller that pauses until `resume_at` and then re-evaluates at the same `now` will immediately get the same pause again, producing a zero-delay loop. This contradicts both the stated contract that `resume_at` is the next reset and the adjacent test for an unknown reset, which correctly falls back to `NOW + recheck_interval`.","digest":"4c6a4b60889155ee","family":"alibaba","location":"tests/test_quota_eval.py:93","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_quota_eval.py:93"}],"chunks_total":2,"coverage":"2/2 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":10254,"diff_sha":"9289940f7439e2cce9e9f7cc9e2faa7353dc515b9aeca24121d83a69c697244b","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/B-quota-pause-eval","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":122.9,"family":"alibaba","findings":2,"max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"[REDACTED:name]","output_digest":"9d4ba8b6046de587","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/B-quota-pause-eval.rubber_duck.grok-4.7.20261112T150430Z-d057454b.jsonl","reason":"","review_degraded":[{"at":1794495870.8144224,"family":"google","gate":"rubber_duck","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","reason":"quota","reviewer":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite"}],"review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2],"reviewed_for_holder":"[REDACTED:hostname]-B-quota-pause-eval-7267fe reviewed [REDACTED:hostname]-ddflow-7267fe's B-quota-pause-eval","reviewed_head":"9187ef5dc27b26ca25b2ddd3d38d49ff9bf3604d","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/services/quota_eval.py":"100644 34ccb143fdd890ccd926a71e20d2bfba8c9abf0b","tests/test_quota_eval.py":"100644 1f060e99b4b1c46080aad048947895758bef502c"},"reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","reviewer_digest":"3926c0df5644d7de","reviewer_families":["alibaba","xai"],"round":1,"rounds":1,"status":"REVIEWED","titles":["quota_eval.py:_one","tests/test_quota_eval.py:93"],"tree_sha":"f15cb361e74f+clean","unreviewed":[],"waves":1},"gate":"rubber_duck","reason":"2 finding(s)"},"id":"ea42e980b0a94965854ebf434","kind":"gate.failed","lamport":184493,"schema":1,"subject":"B-quota-pause-eval","ts":"2026-11-12T15:06:37.385383Z"}
