{"agent":"Monster3-B-quota-pause-eval-7267fe","data":{"by":"Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"In `_one`, `resets = (r.resets_at if r else \"\") or _fixed_reset(w, now)` lets a non-empty `resets_at` from a stale reading suppress the fixed-window calculation. For a fixed window with anchor `1970-01-01T00:00:00Z` and period 3600 seconds, evaluated at `1970-01-01T02:00:00Z`, a stale OK reading whose `resets_at` is from the previous period (`1970-01-01T01:00:00Z`) and whose value is at the limit makes `_one` return that past reset. `decide` then sees a reset not ahead and returns `now + recheck_s` instead of the next fixed reset (`1970-01-01T03:00:00Z`), so the resume/recheck time is wrong and can cause repeated immediate rechecks.","digest":"c9fbec2b3eecbd45","family":"alibaba","location":"ddflow/services/quota_eval.py:67","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/services/quota_eval.py:67"},{"chunk":1,"detail":"`recheck_s <= 0` does not reject `float(\"nan\")`. Given `decide(evals, 1.0, now, float(\"nan\"))` where any over-window has no future reset, validation passes because `nan <= 0` is false, then `_resume_at` returns `now + float(\"nan\")`, producing `Decision.resume_at = nan` even though the contract says resume_at is epoch seconds.","digest":"8b2652c1e4b4d6ae","family":"alibaba","location":"ddflow/services/quota_eval.py:108","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"LOW","title":"ddflow/services/quota_eval.py:108"}],"chunks_total":2,"coverage":"2/2 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":11054,"diff_sha":"657c549ab8a045fabe73f6706781df47671b4fbd1ab2de85842f027184a95a6c","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/B-quota-pause-eval","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":141.8,"family":"alibaba","findings":2,"max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"[REDACTED:name]","output_digest":"69f64909d8f54ec0","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/B-quota-pause-eval.critic.grok-4.7.20261112T151051Z-126f2958.jsonl","reason":"","review_degraded":[{"at":1794496251.952534,"family":"google","gate":"critic","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","reason":"quota","reviewer":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite"}],"review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2],"reviewed_for_holder":"[REDACTED:hostname]-B-quota-pause-eval-7267fe reviewed [REDACTED:hostname]-ddflow-7267fe's B-quota-pause-eval","reviewed_head":"f15cb361e74f5fb176ec9bfe49a08de4498b1e71","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/services/quota_eval.py":"100644 41fe947858a6c7158deb74fa94fa50e0089e4dee","tests/test_quota_eval.py":"100644 b94b76bccd574f1d7fac3b37b4bb104fbf66130b"},"reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","reviewer_digest":"3926c0df5644d7de","reviewer_families":["alibaba","xai"],"round":1,"rounds":1,"status":"REVIEWED","titles":["ddflow/services/quota_eval.py:67","ddflow/services/quota_eval.py:108"],"tree_sha":"f15cb361e74f+clean","unreviewed":[],"waves":1},"gate":"critic","reason":"2 finding(s)"},"id":"ec989a2cbbe98a2cdc875c050","kind":"gate.failed","lamport":184560,"schema":1,"subject":"B-quota-pause-eval","ts":"2026-11-12T15:13:19.119690Z"}
